    "detailed_description": "Welcome to the world of &quot;Bober Constructions&quot;, where your building skills will be put to the ultimate test! Step into the role of one of the four fearless beaver builders and complete each assignment.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGame world is full of challenges, and your goal is to construct the most durable and functional structures, such as bridges, walls, roads, and much more. Each mission requires precision, speed, and cooperation, as time is ticking, and the client might not be satisfied.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDuring gameplay, you'll need to make quick decisions, coordinate actions with other players, and utilize available building materials to create solid structures. Sometimes you'll need to overcome obstacles like abyss or walls to reach your destination.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWith engaging gameplay, colorful graphics, and an absurdly fun atmosphere, &quot;Bober Constructions&quot; will provide you with hours of unforgettable entertainment in the company of your favorite beaver builders (or friends? maybe, idk). Are you ready for the challenge? Let's get to work, beavers!",
    "about_the_game": "Welcome to the world of &quot;Bober Constructions&quot;, where your building skills will be put to the ultimate test! Step into the role of one of the four fearless beaver builders and complete each assignment.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGame world is full of challenges, and your goal is to construct the most durable and functional structures, such as bridges, walls, roads, and much more. Each mission requires precision, speed, and cooperation, as time is ticking, and the client might not be satisfied.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDuring gameplay, you'll need to make quick decisions, coordinate actions with other players, and utilize available building materials to create solid structures. Sometimes you'll need to overcome obstacles like abyss or walls to reach your destination.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWith engaging gameplay, colorful graphics, and an absurdly fun atmosphere, &quot;Bober Constructions&quot; will provide you with hours of unforgettable entertainment in the company of your favorite beaver builders (or friends? maybe, idk). Are you ready for the challenge? Let's get to work, beavers!",
    "short_description": "Bober k***w. Patrz jakie bydle! And even more than just one. 4 beaver-builders, and you can control one of them. Create structures, manage time and resources, watch out for obstacles, and remember, fast action is the key to success!",
